      <div><p class="lp-kicker">The CallTeam buying desk / Email outreach</p><h1>10 best <span>cold email<br> software tools.</span> <small>For B2B sales. Prices and our verdict.</small></h1><p class="lp-intro">See what each tool costs, what is included and when you will have to pay more.</p><div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="#prices">Compare prices ↓</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="#team-costs">See team costs →</a></div><p class="sg-brands">Instantly · Smartlead · lemlist · Apollo · Reply.io · Saleshandy · Mailshake · Woodpecker · QuickMail · Snov.io</p></div>
