  <div class="lp-wrap"><p class="lp-small">Narrowed it to two tools? Read our <a href="/resources/instantly-vs-smartlead/">Instantly vs Smartlead comparison</a> for contact limits, team access and the cost of mailboxes and domains.</p></div>
<section class="lp-section" id="prices"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">01 / The price comparison</p><h2>Cold email software prices:<br>what does each plan include?</h2><p>Prices are in USD, before tax. The annual column shows the monthly rate and the full yearly payment. Email accounts, domains and lead data can cost extra.</p></div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap"><table class="lp-table sg-table ce-prices" role="table"><caption>Ten email outreach tools: entry plans, billing terms and the limits to check</caption><thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Tool and fit</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Monthly billing</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Annual billing</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Included</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Cost to watch</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    {% for p in guide.providers %}<tr role="row" data-price-id="{{ p.id }}"><th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="#{{ p.id }}">{{ p.name }}</a><small>{{ p.plan }}</small><small>{{ p.fit }}</small></th><td role="cell" data-label="Monthly billing"><strong{% if p.monthlyValue == null %} class="ce-price-note"{% endif %}>{{ p.monthly }}</strong><small>{{ p.unit }}</small></td><td role="cell" data-label="Annual billing">{{ p.annual }}{% if p.annualTotal %}<small>{{ p.annualTotal }}</small>{% endif %}</td><td role="cell" data-label="Included">{{ p.capacity }}</td><td role="cell" data-label="Cost to watch">{{ p.extra }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
    </tbody></table></div>
    <p class="sg-sources">Need the contacts first? Compare the <a href="/resources/b2b-lead-providers/">best B2B lead generation databases</a>. For phone coverage beyond Apollo, see our <a href="/resources/apollo-alternatives/">Apollo alternatives for cold calling</a>.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="team-costs"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">02 / Same campaign, different prices</p><h2>What will a seller,<br>sales team or agency pay?</h2><p>Monthly software costs for the setup in each box. These examples assume you already have your list and email accounts. Domains, data, email accounts and tax are extra.</p></div>
    <div class="ce-budget-grid">{% for b in guide.budgets %}<article class="ce-budget" data-budget="{{ loop.index }}"><h3>{{ b.title }}</h3><p>{{ b.description }}</p><table><caption>{{ b.title }}: monthly software cost in USD</caption><tbody>{% for row in b.rows %}<tr><th scope="row">{{ row.name }}</th><td>${{ row.price }}<small>/month</small></td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><p class="ce-budget-take">{{ b.take }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div>
    <p class="sg-sources">Agency calculations: Smartlead $94 + (3 × $29); lemlist 3 × $69; QuickMail $299 + $49. <a href="https://www.smartlead.ai/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smartlead client fees ↗</a> · <a href="https://help.lemlist.com/en/articles/4452690-create-a-team-in-lemlist" target="_blank" rel="noopener">lemlist team billing ↗</a> · <a href="https://quickmail.com/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">QuickMail workspaces ↗</a></p>
    <div class="ce-budget-rule"><h3>Count your follow-ups too.</h3><p>One email and two follow-ups to 1,000 people can mean 3,000 sends. Some messages will stop after a reply or bounce. Buy enough capacity for the full campaign.</p><p>Before buying more software, check whether your <a href="/resources/best-crm-for-outbound-sales/">outbound CRM</a> already covers the sequence and call tasks you need.</p></div>
    <div class="sg-mid-cta"><p><strong>Already emailing the right companies?</strong> Hire CallTeam to make the calls, qualify interest and follow up alongside your email campaign.</p><a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="email-cost">Talk to CallTeam ↗</a></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="reviews"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">03 / The CallTeam verdicts</p><h2>Which cold email tools<br>are worth your money?</h2><p>Here is what each tool does well, where it falls short and when we would pay for it.</p></div>
    {% for p in guide.providers %}<article class="lp-provider" id="{{ p.id }}"><header class="lp-provider-head"><div><p class="lp-kicker">{{ p.fit }}</p><h3>{{ p.name }}: pricing, strengths and limits</h3></div><a class="lp-source" href="{{ p.sources[0][1] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check official pricing ↗</a></header><div class="lp-provider-body"><div class="lp-provider-detail"><h4>What works</h4><p>{{ p.good }}</p><h4>The drawback</h4><p>{{ p.weak }}</p></div><aside class="lp-verdict"><p class="lp-kicker">CallTeam's verdict</p><p class="lp-verdict-text">{{ p.verdict }}</p></aside></div><p class="lp-sources">Official sources: {% for s in p.sources %}<a href="{{ s[1] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ s[0] }} ↗</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p></article>{% endfor %}
    <div class="sg-two sg-after"><div><h3>Instantly vs Smartlead</h3><p>A team needs Instantly Hypergrowth at $107 a month or Smartlead Pro at $94. Try handling replies with both. For agencies, Instantly charges for each separate workspace; Smartlead Pro adds a fee for each client workspace.</p><p><a href="#instantly">Review Instantly</a> · <a href="#smartlead">Review Smartlead</a></p></div><div><h3>lemlist vs Reply.io</h3><p>lemlist Email includes unlimited users at $69 a month. Reply's Email Volume plan with unlimited users starts at $179. For email-only teams, lemlist has the lower starting cost. Compare their multichannel plans if you also need other sales channels.</p><p><a href="#lemlist">Review lemlist</a> · <a href="#reply">Review Reply.io</a></p></div></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="calling"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">04 / Give the campaign a caller</p><h2>How cold calling can support<br>your email campaign.</h2><p>A call lets you ask a question and hear the answer. Find the right person, understand what is holding them back and agree on the next step.</p></div>
    <div class="sg-flow"><div><h3>A company you want to reach has not replied.</h3><p>Call with a clear reason. Explain the problem you help solve and ask whether they face it. Skip “Did you read my email?”</p><p>Choose the route with our <a href="/resources/how-to-buy-cold-calling-leads/">mobile vs company number guide</a>.</p></div><div><h3>You are reaching the wrong person.</h3><p>Ask who handles the decision. Update the contact, stop the old follow-ups and send the right person a useful message.</p><p>Record who will follow up and when.</p></div><div><h3>An interested prospect goes quiet.</h3><p>Call to ask about timing or answer the question holding things up. Agree on what happens next, then send the details.</p><p>Update the CRM so another rep knows where things stand.</p></div></div>
    <p class="sg-note"><strong>Track conversations and meetings people attend.</strong> Email opens tell you little about buying interest. Call companies that fit your offer. Honour requests to stop contact across both email and phone.</p>
    <div class="gr-resources"><h3>Prepare an opening that fits the buyer.</h3><p>Use a free calling script, then check the wording before your first session.</p>{% include "components/free-calling-resources.njk" %}</div>
  </div></section>

